{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_101","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > /tmp/8f3-report.py <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,re,subprocess,time,datetime,collections\nbefore=json.loads(Path('/tmp/8f3-before-tests.json').read_text())\nafter={str(p):re.findall(r'\\\\(deftest\\\\s+(?:\\\\\"'^'\"\\\\S+\\\\s+)*([\"'^'\"\\\\s()]+)',p.read_text()) for p in Path('test').rglob('*') if p.suffix in ('.clj','.cljc','.cljs','.cljd')}\nremoved=[(f,n) for f,ns in before.items() for n in ns if n not in after.get(f,[])]\nadded=[(f,n) for f,ns in after.items() for n in ns if n not in before.get(f,[])]\nsem={\n'create-vm-test':'Adapted, same resource/construction assertions: semantic_register/vm_test/create-vm-test.',\n'load-image-decodes-refs-and-opcodes-test':'Retired: v3 segment references and numeric opcode decoding; no v4 numeric stack-opcode image exists. v4 image contract: semantic_register/vm_test/image-shape.',\n'load-image-rejects-ill-formed-batches-test':'Retired v3 batch grammar. Refusal-before-execution survives in semantic_register/vm_test/loader-refusals-are-the-validators and code_test/refusal-rows-name-rule-and-pc.',\n'load-image-verifies-a-claimed-address-test':'Retired v3 :yin.code/hash claim attribute and batch admission API. Address authenticity now lives in mint_test/fetch-refuses-bad-content; computed address and aliases in semantic_register/vm_test/image-shape.',\n'load-vector-decodes-and-aliases-test':'Adapted coverage: semantic_register/vm_test/image-shape, segment-ids; load_paths_test/both-paths-one-image. Numeric opcode folding retired with the old image.',\n'load-vector-mints-below-the-loaded-floor-test':'Covered by semantic_register/vm_test/segment-ids and attach_image_test/semantic-attach-mints-a-local-id-and-an-alias-test. The literal -16 is retired: it counted v3 instruction rows.',\n'load-vector-refuses-malformed-vectors-test':'Retired v3 vector fixtures; v4 exact defect assertions survive in semantic_regis