gn':'V3 vector layout retired; v4 exact worked example lives in semantic_register/linearize_test/worked-example-is-byte-for-byte-the-design.',\n'lower-rows-provenance-is-one-row-per-pc-keyed-by-occurrence':'Covered by semantic_register/linearize_test/provenance-is-one-row-per-pc and shared-occurrences-expand-positionally. Exact v3 instruction/path list retired with the v3 lowering layout.',\n'lower-rows-rejects-incomplete-source-occurrence-identities':'Same invalid origins and exact :origin assertion in semantic_register/linearize_test/lower-rows-rejects-incomplete-source-occurrence-identities.',\n'lower-envelope-stamps-the-selected-member-source-origin':'Old lower-envelope API retired. The ported test_utils/run-encoder-session selects the envelope member, validates bounds and uses vm/source-origin; semantic_stream_observer_test/the-two-observer-stages-compose-end-to-end-test retains envelope execution assertion; project-rows provenance-is-one-row-per-pc retains origin/root identity.',\n'lower-rows-provenance-paths-resolve-to-the-emitting-node':'Covered by semantic_register/linearize_test/provenance-is-one-row-per-pc and shared-occurrences-expand-positionally; v3 pc/path correspondence retired with stack lowering.',\n'lower-rows-vector-decodes-to-the-datom-path-image':'Same two-path image fact in semantic_register/load_paths_test/both-paths-one-image and round-tripped-rows-load-to-the-same-image; v3 opcode image retired.',\n'lower-rows-rejects-malformed-row-sets':'Same malformed row corpus in semantic_register/linearize_test/malformed-row-sets-are-refused and ported semantic_stream_observer_test/a-malformed-row-set-is-rejected-by-the-row-fed-loader-test.',\n'lower-rows-evaluation-order-matches-the-walker':'Adapted to real register execution in semantic_register/linearize_test/lower-rows-evaluation-order-matches-the-walker; same log equality and result 11 assertions.'\n}\nchanged=subprocess.check_output(['git','diff','--name-only'],text=True).splitlines()\nported=[]\